return {
    ["\n龙啸将至。\n我将不<Hide id=\"#157\">畏高、不惧火、不后退。我将不恋温床，不贪安逸，</>不向恐惧低头。\n我这平庸的人生，注定<Hide id=\"#157\">光辉万丈</>。\n我要将旗帜，<Hide id=\"#157\">插在最高</>的地方。\n我是刺向龙<Hide id=\"#157\">心的长矛，龙焰中的坚盾，风暴里的号角，黑暗之中的光芒。</>\n为猎龙献上生命与心脏！\n\n猎龙人：凯文·斯托克   <Hide id=\"#157\">瑞尔·比</>伯"] = "\nDragon's roar is coming.\nI will not <Hide id=\"#157\">fear heights, fear fire, or retreat. I will not cling to a warm bed, or covet comfort,</> or bow to horror.\nThis mediocre life of mine is destined to be <Hide id=\"#157\">glorious</>.\nI will plant the flag <Hide id=\"#157\">at the highest</> place.\nI am the spear piercing the dragon's <Hide id=\"#157\">heart, the shield in the dragon's fire, the horn in the storm, the light in the darkness.</>\nOffer my life and heart for dragon hunting!\n\nDragon Hunter: Kevin Stock   <Hide id=\"#157\">Ray Bieber</>",
