    ["<Assistant_Title1>【教团选择与属性加点】</>\n加入教团时会进入类似跑团角色创建的流程，主要分为<Assistant_Property1>教团</>、<Assistant_Property1>信仰</>、<Assistant_Property1>属性</>三步。\n\n<Assistant_Title2>规则说明：</>\n1. 选择教团后，该教团的能力与信仰会自动确定。\n2. 每个教团有推荐属性方案，可以直接使用推荐加点。\n3. 属性基础值最低为 8，最高为 16，总属性点为 44。\n\n<Assistant_Title3>推荐搜索：</>{SendAnswer:[教团属性说明]|1275}，{SendAnswer:[如何加入教团]|1273}"] = "<Assistant_Title1> [Covenant Selection and Attribute Points] </>\n When joining a Covenant, you will enter a process similar to tabletop RPG character creation, mainly divided into three steps: <Assistant_Property1> Covenant </>, <Assistant_Property1> Faith </>, and <Assistant_Property1> Attributes </>. \n\n<Assistant_Title2> Rules Explanation: </>\n 1. After selecting a Covenant, the abilities and faith of that Covenant will be automatically determined. \n 2. Each Covenant has a recommended attribute scheme, which you can use directly. \n 3. The base attribute value is at least 8 and at most 16, with a total of 44 attribute points. \n\n<Assistant_Title3> Recommended Searches: </> {SendAnswer: [Covenant Attribute Explanation] | 1275 }, {SendAnswer: [How to Join a Covenant] | 1273 }",
