    ["“接过它，你再也没有怯懦的资格了。”  \n许多年前，科林·伊利亚特从前任首席手中接过这顶冠冕开始，这句话就时常回荡在他耳边。\n为了守护白银城，他总会毫不迟疑地拔剑，无论对手，无论代价。\n即使现在面对的是掩埋历史的天使之王，即使那代价会倾覆自己的所有。\n他依然拔出剑来，剑锋直指幽暗的最深处，绝无退缩，绝无迟疑。\n阳光炽烈，鲜血滚烫，他从未感觉如此自豪。"] = "'Accept it, and you no longer have the qualification to be cowardly.' \n Many years ago, when Colin Iliad accepted this crown from the previous Chief, this sentence often echoed in his ears. \n To protect the City of Silver, he would always draw his sword without hesitation, regardless of the opponent, regardless of the cost. \n Even if he is now facing a King of Angels who buries history, even if the cost would overturn everything he has. \n He still drew his sword, the blade pointing directly into the deepest darkness, never retreating, never hesitating. \n The sun was scorching, the blood was boiling, he had never felt so proud.",
